{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "jenkins-operator-reconcile-walkthrough",
  "title": "One pass through reconcile: base first, user configuration second",
  "subtitle": "Function order in jenkins_controller.go. Every completed step records a timestamp in the CR status; a step that fails requeues the pass.",
